---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Escape to the Kitchen">
  <article class="container">
    <h1 class="page-heading mb-6 text-3xl tracking-tight">About</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-prose">
      <p>Welcome to Escape to the Kitchen! We're the Fox family, and we're happy to share our family recipes for anyone to browse, cook, and enjoy.</p>
      <p>We don't believe in perfection here—just good food. We keep our recipes, ingredients, and directions simple, and we believe you don't need a whole story about a recipe to enjoy it.</p>
      <p>Sometimes, that means our ingredient amounts and directions are more like suggestions than strict instructions. We trust our intuition about good food, and we believe you should trust yours too.</p>
      <p>So have fun, escape to the kitchen, and make something tasty!</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
